sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Human
  participant P as Planner<br/>large
  participant I as Implementer<br/>medium
  participant T as Helper<br/>small
  participant C as Tests + CI<br/>no model
  participant A as Auditor<br/>large<br/>fresh context
  H->>P: spec
  P-->>H: plan
  H->>I: approve plan
  I->>T: grep, fetch
  I->>C: code + tests
  loop until gates + audit pass
    C-->>I: failures
    I->>C: fixes
    C->>A: green run
    A-->>I: findings
  end
  A->>H: audit report
  Note over H: decides merge
